# BuildKit reads this file (not the root .dockerignore) for
# `docker build -f infra/docker/api.Dockerfile .` — the context is the repo root.
#
# ALLOWLIST: exclude everything, then re-include only what the api image needs.
# Anything not listed below (apps/api/.env, .git, apps/web, infra/, docs/) never
# reaches the builder, so it can't end up in a public GHCR image (CLAUDE.md §2).
*
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/uv.lock
!apps/api/pitchbend_live/
!apps/api/tests/

# Re-exclude secrets and local artifacts even inside the allowlisted directories.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
